UID:j30fblv7a8mtrtcirs214k3cto@google.com
CREATED:20260607T211934Z
DESCRIPTION:HC Cheer Team Bonding BBQ Announcement\nWe are excited to announce our first Team Bonding Event of the season!\nThis event will be program-wide and is a great opportunity for all of our athletes to come together\, build friendships\, and celebrate the end of our June practices as one team.\n📅 Date: Thursday\, June 11th (weather permitting)\n📍 Location: Daniella Pereira's House\n1 Stothoff Ct\, Flemington \n⏰ Time: Immediately following practice\n\nTo help cover the cost of food and supplies\, we are asking for a $10 donation per athlete.\nVenmo: Christy-Pereira-2\nWe are looking forward to a fun evening of team spirit\, laughter\, and making memories together. Thank you for your support\, and we can't wait to see everyone there!\n🤘🏼📣❤️
LAST-MODIFIED:20260607T211934Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Program Bonding
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
